# Security headers. Standard: AIOS pipelines/web-build/security-headers.md.
# No includeSubDomains or preload on HSTS (see the standard for why).
# The CSP allowlist is every third party the site loads, recorded from the live site and
# crawl-tested September 26, 2026. The booking page (/book) loads the shared booking form from
# book.motive11.com, Cloudflare's bot check (challenges.cloudflare.com), and Stripe's card form
# (js.stripe.com, api.stripe.com, hooks.stripe.com, and payment for Apple Pay / Google Pay), added
# October 30, 2026. Adding a new embed or script means adding its origin here in the same change,
# or it is silently blocked on the live site.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(self "https://js.stripe.com" "https://pay.google.com"), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://book.motive11.com https://js.stripe.com https://*.js.stripe.com https://cdn.usefathom.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://api.fontshare.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://cdn.usefathom.com; font-src 'self' data: https://cdn.fontshare.com https://api.fontshare.com; media-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://cdn.usefathom.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://book.motive11.com https://api.stripe.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://js.stripe.com https://*.js.stripe.com https://hooks.stripe.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
